        {
          "id": 1,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Iran called for Qatar to release three Iranian pilots it stated were captured after two fighter jets were hit by air defences at the start of the US-Iran war.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj4kk8kz271o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Iranian Brig Gen Mohammad Bagherzadeh stated in a letter to the ICRC that pilots Javad Salehi, Abdul Majid Dashtian, and Imran Behroshian had been held captive by Qatar for six months.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj4kk8kz271o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Bagherzadeh stated that the body of a fourth pilot, Majid Kazemi, was returned after he was killed during the combat mission on March 2, 2026.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj4kk8kz271o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Qatar denied Iran's allegations regarding the detention of the pilots, describing them as misleading statements.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj4kk8kz271o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Qatari Foreign Ministry spokesman Majed Al-Ansari confirmed Qatari air defence forces engaged two Iranian warplanes in March after they breached Qatari airspace without responding to warnings.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/8/15/qatar-denies-it-is-detaining-three-iranian-bomber-pilots?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "In early March 2026, Qatar's Defence Ministry reported shooting down two Iranian Sukhoi Su-24 bombers during an attack on Al Udeid Air Base.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/8/15/qatar-denies-it-is-detaining-three-iranian-bomber-pilots?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US President Donald Trump stated in New York that Iran was being 'very badly defeated' and suggested he would soon declare the Hormuz Strait a territory of the United States.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/8/15/qatar-denies-it-is-detaining-three-iranian-bomber-pilots?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Iranian Deputy Foreign Minister Kazem Gharibabadi posted on X that the Strait of Hormuz 'cannot be seized with a tweet, nor with an aircraft carrier'.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/8/15/qatar-denies-it-is-detaining-three-iranian-bomber-pilots?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Kazem Gharibabadi stated on X that 'The Strait of Hormuz has been Iranian, is Iranian, and will remain Iranian'.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/iran-fires-back-trumps-threat-declare-hormuz-us-territory-6321731",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "UAE state-owned oil giant ADNOC reported that one of its vessels was attacked in the Strait of Hormuz on Friday night.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/iran-fires-back-trumps-threat-declare-hormuz-us-territory-6321731",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "A US defense official told NPR that the aircraft carrier USS George Washington is en route to relieve the USS Abraham Lincoln.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "NPR World",
          "url": "https://www.npr.org/2026/08/15/nx-s1-5932539/uss-lincoln-trump-dire-conditions",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Acting Secretary of the Navy Hung Cao stated that the deployment of the USS Lincoln was extended because the conflict with Iran demanded it.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "NPR World",
          "url": "https://www.npr.org/2026/08/15/nx-s1-5932539/uss-lincoln-trump-dire-conditions",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "The USS Abraham Lincoln has spent more than 240 consecutive days at sea during its Middle East deployment.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/world/trumps-iran-war-pulls-uss-george-washington-from-pacific-giving-china-an-opening-what-to-know-11786810935766.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cluster_id": 1,
      "headline_hint": "Powerful 7.7-magnitude earthquake and aftershocks hit eastern Indonesia, killing dozens",
      "section": "world",
