          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "NDTV",
          "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/education/afghanistan-marks-5-years-under-the-taliban-with-safer-streets-but-pleas-for-jobs-and-education-11914676#publisher=newsstand",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
